<title>CYPRUS: Cyprus accepts Glencore wheat tender.</title>
<headline>Cyprus accepts Glencore wheat tender.</headline>
<dateline>NICOSIA 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Cyprus Grain Commission on Tuesday accepted the tender of Glencore Grain Rotterdam for the supply of 12,000 tonnes of European bread-making wheat at $149.75 per tonne.</p>
<p>The price was on a C&amp;F basis, a statement from the commission said.</p>
</text>
